r-sha` (or `--i-understand-no-gate-2-verification` with CAUTION audit). This is intentional: once an adopter has hit a break-glass, we demand operator-explicit SHA confirmation on every re-enable for the rest of the adopter's lifetime. The restore log entry in git history is the authoritative record; force-push to main is disabled (D-030) so the entry cannot be expunged.\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:126:ACK_RESTORE_ADMIN_REMOVAL=0\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:127:ACK_RESTORE_REQUIRED_CHECKS_REMOVAL=0\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:128:ACK_RESTORE_SIGNATURES_REMOVAL=0\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:129:ACK_RESTORE_FORCE_PUSHES=0\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:130:ACK_RESTORE_DELETIONS=0\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:164:                           Bypass the forward-mode prior-green-CI safety\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:177:                           allow_force_pushes.\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:178:  --i-understand-restore-re-enables-deletions\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:180:                           allow_deletions.\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:225:    --i-understand-restore-removes-admin-enforcement) ACK_RESTORE_ADMIN_REMOVAL=1; shift ;;\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:226:    --i-understand-restore-removes-required-checks) ACK_RESTORE_REQUIRED_CHECKS_REMOVAL=1; shift ;;\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:227:    --i-understand-restore-disables-required-signatures) ACK_RESTORE_SIGNATURES_REMOVAL=1; shift ;;\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:228:    --i-understand-restore-re-enables-force-pushes) ACK_RESTORE_FORCE_PUSHES=1; shift ;;\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:229:    --i-understand-restore-re-enables-deletions) ACK_RESTORE_DELETIONS=1; shift ;;\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:585:check_forward_mode_safety() {\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:695:  check_forward_mode_safety\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:726:       allow_force_pushes: false,\nscripts/enable-required-check.sh:727:       allow_deletions: fa